  ('glyancevyiy-tint-dlya-gub-berry-glaze-vinnyiy-100844', 'Berry Glaze 镜面唇釉', '彩妆', (SELECT id FROM product_categories WHERE name = '彩妆' LIMIT 1), '镜面唇釉，经历风、三杯咖啡和一场热烈约会，依然能留在唇上。

